  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.2.2\n\n- Align the package version and contract engine dependency with the hosted authoring validation release.\n\n## 0.2.1\n\n- Correct the contract review destination printed in validation reports.\n- Correct public documentation and product links.\n- Align the package version with the Echo package release and include NuGet release notes and symbols.\n\n## 0.1.1\n\n- Validate consumed contracts against committed snapshots, with explicit compatibility results and offline behavior.",
